.env.local
node_modules
dist

# Committed on purpose: the Convex CI typecheck (tsc -b) needs these generated
# bindings, and `convex codegen` requires deployment credentials CI doesn't
# have. They are deterministic and regenerated by `convex dev --once` on every
# Convex edit, so keep them in sync with src/convex/* when committing.
src/convex/_generated
